#. translators: %s: how many images.
#: includes/class-cli.php:698
#: assets/build/bulk.js:29
#, php-format,js-format
msgid "%s image was left as the other plugin made it: its original is gone, too large to send, or only that plugin can put it back. Its panel in the media library says which."
msgid_plural "%s images were left as the other plugins made them: their originals are gone, too large to send, or only those plugins can put them back. Their panels in the media library say which."
msgstr[0] "이미지 %s개는 다른 플러그인이 만든 상태 그대로 두었습니다. 원본이 없거나, 보내기에 너무 크거나, 그 플러그인만 원본을 되돌릴 수 있기 때문입니다. 미디어 라이브러리의 이미지 패널에서 이유를 확인하세요."

#. translators: %s: how many images.
#: includes/class-cli.php:706
#: assets/build/bulk.js:28
